@startuml
title A-COP deployment units and packaging boundary
skinparam backgroundColor #faf9ff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4b5563
skinparam LineColor #4b5563
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #f5f3ff
  BorderColor #7c3aed
  BackgroundColor<<release>> #dbeafe
  BorderColor<<release>> #2563eb
  BackgroundColor<<admin>> #fce7f3
  BorderColor<<admin>> #db2777
  BackgroundColor<<phase2>> #fef3c7
  BorderColor<<phase2>> #d97706
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #ede9fe
  BorderColor #7c3aed
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #cffafe
  BorderColor #0891b2
}

together {
node "개발 환경\nPhase 1 / 현재" as Dev {
  artifact "소스 트리\napp/core · app/application\napp/domain · app/infrastructure" as Source
  artifact "acop_basement wheel" as BasementDev
  artifact "acop_composer wheel" as ComposerDev
}

node "고객용 릴리즈 빌드\n항상 설치 대상" <<release>> as CustomerBuild {
  artifact "acop_basement\nCore / Team / Registry / Controller" as BasementRelease
  node "A-COP Runtime" as CustomerRuntime
  CustomerRuntime ..> BasementRelease : 설치
}

node "관리용 빌드\n선택 설치 대상" <<admin>> as AdminBuild {
  artifact "acop_basement" as BasementAdmin
  artifact "acop_composer\n토글 endpoint glue" as ComposerAdmin
  node "A-COP Runtime +\nComposer endpoint" as AdminRuntime
  AdminRuntime ..> BasementAdmin : 설치
  AdminRuntime ..> ComposerAdmin : 선택 설치
}

AdminBuild -[hidden]down-> Dev
}

CustomerBuild -[hidden]down-> AdminBuild

node "final_project_ui\n독립 서비스\n패키지 아님" as UI {
  artifact "UI service" as UIArtifact
}

package "Shared infrastructure" as SharedInfra {
  database "PostgreSQL\n+ pgvector" as PostgreSQL
  database "Graph DB\n선택: Phase 2 / 채택 게이트" <<phase2>> as GraphDB
  node "LLM provider" as LLM
  node "A2A Remote\nCatalog & Verification" as A2A
}

UI -[hidden]right-> CustomerBuild
CustomerBuild -[hidden]right-> SharedInfra

Source ..> BasementDev : 빌드
Source ..> ComposerDev : 빌드
BasementDev ..> BasementRelease : 고객용 패키지
BasementDev ..> BasementAdmin : 관리용 패키지
ComposerDev ..> ComposerAdmin : 관리용 패키지

UI --> CustomerRuntime : HTTP only
UI --> AdminRuntime : HTTP only
CustomerRuntime --> SharedInfra : shared services
AdminRuntime --> SharedInfra : shared services

note right of SharedInfra
  데이터 접근 -> PostgreSQL
  GraphStorePort -> Graph DB
  LLMPort -> LLM provider
  A2A Adapter -> A2A Remote
end note

note right of Dev
현재 기준: 로컬 개발 환경에는 Docker가 없다.
로컬은 PostgreSQL 직접 실행으로 진행한다.
end note

note bottom of CustomerBuild
고객용 빌드에는 acop_composer가 존재하지 않는다.
acop_basement는 컴포저 코드를 포함하지 않는다.
end note

note bottom of AdminBuild
관리용 빌드만 acop_composer를 선택 설치한다.
final_project_ui는 pip 패키지가 아니며
대상 Python을 import하지 않는다.
end note

node "실제 배포\nPhase 2" <<phase2>> as DeployPhase
artifact "컨테이너 이미지\n고객용 / 관리용" <<phase2>> as Images
node "AWS 배포 대상\nPhase 2" <<phase2>> as AWS
DeployPhase ..> Images : 컨테이너화
Images ..> AWS : 배포
CustomerBuild ..> DeployPhase : 배포
AdminBuild ..> DeployPhase : 배포

legend bottom right
|색상|의미|
|<#dbeafe>|고객용 릴리즈 단위|
|<#fce7f3>|관리용 빌드 단위|
|<#fef3c7>|Phase 2 선택 기술 / 실제 배포|
|artifact|패키지·빌드 산출물|
|database|데이터 저장소|
endlegend
@enduml
